196
00:11:25.158 --> 00:11:26.783
Silly girl, it's on the inside.

197
00:11:26.908 --> 00:11:27.867
You know what, lshu...

198
00:11:28.033 --> 00:11:31.075
since the time I was a kid,
I loved studying.

199
