- Vent it out.

218
00:12:16.575 --> 00:12:18.158
Come on, Veer... be your name.

219
00:12:18.242 --> 00:12:19.658
Come on, Veer... be your name!

220
00:12:19.825 --> 00:12:21.533
- Say it.
- Say it!

221
00:12:23.617 --> 00:12:24.575
I...

222
