225
00:12:36.908 --> 00:12:40.825
If I fold my hands and apologies
in front of you. He won't like it.

226
00:12:40.950 --> 00:12:41.992
After all, he's my younger brother.

227
00:12:42.117 --> 00:12:43.242
But don't worry.

228
00:12:43.367 --> 00:12:46.033
