like you did.

952
01:01:16.783 --> 01:01:20.908
Meera... after today don't ever
show me your face again.

953
01:01:22.700 --> 01:01:24.242
I will kill you.

954
01:01:50.158 --> 01:01:52.950
"Goodbye. ."

955
